sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer Browser
  participant API as Product API
  participant APP as Checkout Use Case
  participant DB as SQL Server
  C->>API: POST Checkout + Idempotency-Key
  API->>APP: Resolve trusted Store + Customer
  APP->>DB: Look up idempotency result
  alt Existing completed key
    DB-->>APP: Stored result
    APP-->>API: Existing order response
  else New checkout
    APP->>DB: Begin transaction
    APP->>DB: Re-read products/prices/settings/stock
    APP->>DB: Validate fulfillment/fees/address
    APP->>DB: Reserve stock atomically
    APP->>DB: Insert Order + snapshots + history + idempotency result
    APP->>DB: Commit
    DB-->>APP: Commit succeeded
    APP-->>API: Order response
  end
  API-->>C: 201/200 contract result
